The '''Braton''' is a {{Faction|Tenno}} assault rifle with balanced damage, [[fire rate]], and [[accuracy]]. It is a versatile rifle, performing effectively against all enemies without specialty.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage by a small margin.

{{Advantages|*Low recoil.|name=Braton}}

